      "notes": [
         {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "The bson_strfreev function in the MongoDB C driver library may be susceptible to an integer overflow where the function will try to free memory at a negative offset. This may result in memory corruption. This issue affected libbson versions prior to 1.26.2",
            "title": "Vulnerability Description"
         }
      ],
